Why does this trampoline avoid stack overflow in JavaScript?

```javascript
// The driver invokes returned steps.
const run = f => (...a) => {
  let r = f(...a);
  while (typeof r === "function")
    r = r();
  return r;
};
const even = n =>
  n === 0 ? true : () => odd(n - 1);
const odd = n =>
  n === 0 ? false : () => even(n - 1);
run(even)(1e6);
```
